---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<Layout title="Terms of Use — Shenzhen Beaches Website & Content" description="Terms of use for Shenzhen Beaches: how you may use our beach guides and photos, who is responsible for travel information, and how to ask to republish." dateModified="2026-09-29">
  <Nav />
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-2">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: 29 September 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p>These terms explain how you may use <strong>shenzhen-beach.com</strong>, the independent Shenzhen beach guide operated by the Shenzhen Beaches team. By using the site you accept them. If you do not, please leave the site.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-3">Using the Guides</h2>
      <p>The site is free for personal, non-commercial use: reading the guides, printing a beach page for your trip, saving our cheat sheet, and sharing links to any page. No account, booking form, or payment is required on this site — we never sell tickets, tours, or accommodation.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-3">Accuracy of Travel Information</h2>
      <p>Entrance fees, transport routes, ferry timetables, reservation rules, and beach opening status change often, sometimes at short notice and sometimes because of weather or typhoon warnings. Every page states when we last checked it by hand, and we update pages whenever a route or fee changes. Before you travel, confirm the details that matter to you with the operators named on the page — <a href="https://www.szmc.net/" class="text-ocean underline underline-offset-2" rel="noopener">Shenzhen Metro</a> for rail, the <a href="https://meeb.sz.gov.cn/" class="text-ocean underline underline-offset-2" rel="noopener">Shenzhen Ecology Bureau</a> for swimming-grade water reports, and the <a href="https://en.nia.gov.cn/n147418/n147463/c183412/content.html" class="text-ocean underline underline-offset-2" rel="noopener">National Immigration Administration</a> for entry rules.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-3">Safety</h2>
      <p>Swimming at any beach is at your own risk. Our notes on patrols, lifeguard hours, and rip currents describe what we observed on our visits; they are not a substitute for the flags, signage, and instructions on the sand on the day you visit. Unpatrolled beaches listed on this site are marked as such so you can plan accordingly.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-3">Our Text and Photographs</h2>
      <p>The writing and photography on this site are our own work, made on location. You may quote a short extract — up to about 100 words — with a visible link back to the original page, which is the credit we ask for and the reason we publish. Republishing whole pages, copying the photo library, or using our content to train or supply another commercial service needs written permission first; write to us through the <a href="/contact/" class="text-ocean underline underline-offset-2">contact page</a> and we will answer quickly.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-3">Links to Other Sites</h2>
      <p>We link to official operators, government bureaus, and map or video providers because their information is better than ours. Those sites are independent: once you click through, their own terms and privacy policies apply.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-3">Liability</h2>
      <p>The site is provided as-is, without warranty of any kind. We aim to be accurate and current, and we fix errors as soon as they are reported, but we cannot be liable for a missed train, a closed beach, or any loss arising from reliance on information here. Travel decisions are yours to make.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-3">Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>We update this page when the site changes — for example when we add a new kind of content or a new third-party service. The date at the top of the page shows the current version.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-3">Contact and Related Policies</h2>
      <p>Questions about permission, corrections, or anything else on this site: use the <a href="/contact/" class="text-ocean underline underline-offset-2">contact page</a>. To see how the site handles data and cookies, read the <a href="/privacy/" class="text-ocean underline underline-offset-2">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
